e751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a164592c16c3d7fb\" href=\"?note=a164592c16c3d7fb\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model\">58-df-zfc-model2-ultraproduct-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7UltrapowerModel}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7UltrapowerModel}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7UltrapowerModel}_S(\\mathcal N,M,I,U)\\leftrightarrow \\exists F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,\\{M\\})\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(F(i)=M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S(\\mathcal N,F,I,U)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7UltrapowerModel}_S(\\mathcal N,M,I,U)\\leftrightarrow \\exists F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,\\{M\\})\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(F(i)=M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel2UltraproductModel}_S(\\mathcal N,F,I,U)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The constant family is an explicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-indexed set function, rather than a globally named <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_M\">\\(F_M\\)</span> whose dependence on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> was hidden.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","le